
== 1. Northbank searches a shared index (k=3) ==========================
query: 'riverside credit union acquisition'
                        filter after  filter inside
----------------------  ------------  -------------
index without Westfund  2             2            
index with Westfund     0             2            
With 'filter after', Northbank's own results vanish when another
tenant holds closer matches. The count is the leak.

